  "construction": "Two-block group-algebra code C(a,b) of arXiv:2610.13880 (Table 2) over the abelian group C30 x C2 (GAP SmallGroup(60,13)): H_X = (L(a) | R(b)), H_Z = (R(b)^T | L(a)^T) with L and R the left and right regular representations, a = 1 + x^6 + x^16 y + x^23 + x^24 y, b = 1 + x^2 y + x^21 y + x^29 in generators x (order 30) and y (order 2), i.e. the bivariate bicycle code with A = a(x,y), B = b(x,y). The stored matrices use the qubit ordering of the paper's database (record 48f7b618587ebe65, github.com/gideonlsx/bicycle-race @ aed705a, data/codes.jsonl, CC BY 4.0): qubits 0..59 are the left block and 60..119 the right block, group elements numbered as GAP's Elements(SmallGroup(60,13)) with e0 the identity, x = e16, y = e2, so a = e0 + e4 + e19 + e44 + e50, b = e0 + e14 + e42 + e57. Rebuilt from the database's group data; CSS commutation, k, check weight and both of the paper's witnesses were re-checked on the rebuilt matrices.",
  "origin": "baseline",
