  "notes": "Literature reconstruction. The paper states d = 10 exactly (d_X: equal to d_Z by a checked X/Z-exchange automorphism; d_Z: ladder (cluster engine, symmetry roots), from the screen's lower bound 10, no target; verification record: verified: second exact engine (dist-m4ri from symmetry roots), GAP rebuild, QDistRnd, QDistEvol). Readings here: qldpc submit's RIS (20,000 NumPy trials per side) and its 2,000,000-trial accelerator pass, plus the verifier's refutation search; witnessed upper bound, see notes/120-24-10.md.",
